cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use ReelForge in your work, please cite it as below.'
title: 'ReelForge'
abstract: >-
  ReelForge turns a voice recording and one episode.yaml into 1080x1920 vertical explainer videos.
  Its render engine is deterministic (DOM/SVG in headless Chromium, encoded by FFmpeg) and contains no
  AI; optional local helpers provide speech alignment and scene suggestions.
type: software
authors:
